Ultrasonic technology has become an increasingly important means of strengthening. In addition to the above-mentioned applications, it also has excellent application potential in other fields to be developed.
As we all know, “three transfers and one reaction” in metallurgical process is the essential factor affecting process efficiency, speed and capacity, and also summarizes the whole process of metallurgical and chemical production. The so-called “three transfers” refer to mass transfer, momentum transfer and heat transfer, and “one reaction” refers to the process of chemical reaction.
Through the unique effect of ultrasonic technology, it can effectively improve the efficiency and speed of “three transmission and one reaction” in the metallurgical process, improve the mineral activity, reduce the amount of raw materials and shorten the reaction time, so as to achieve the purpose of energy saving and consumption reduction.
