In fact, the dustproof and waterproof grade of electronic products is generally expressed by IP. According to the waterproof technology and manufacturing process, the products of Hengmei Technology can basically reach the level of IP67 and IP68 waterproof.
IP68 is the highest level of dustproof and waterproof grade standard. How to evaluate the shell solid and waterproof performance, mainly to see IPXX after the two digits XX.
The second X is a waterproof rating, ranging from 0 to 8, with the highest rating being 8.
IPX2 has no effect when the housing is tilted to 15 degrees
IPX4 liquid in any direction to the shell has no effect
IPX6 can be used in the cabin, big waves environment
Why is it not recommended for hot showers
Generally, it is difficult for electronic products with waterproof function to enter water when taking a cold shower. However, due to the strong permeability of water vapor molecules in a hot bath, water vapor generated by hot shower, sauna and hot spring is easy to enter the inner part of the bracelet, which will cause the function of the bracelet to be unable to be used in serious cases.
