Hard Taginstallation First determine the position of the label on the product, pass the matching nail out from the inside of the product, align the hole of the label with the nail, press the label nail with your thumb until all the nails are inserted into the label hole, and you will Hear a “cuckling” sound.
For leather goods, the nails should pass through the button hole as much as possible to avoid damage to the leather. For leather goods without button holes, a special rope buckle can be used to put on the ring of the leather goods, and then nail a hard label.
