Does the supermarket choose RF system or AM system?
From the perspective of price, the RF anti-theft system is cheaper than the AM anti-theft system.
From the aspect of anti-interference ability, the anti-interference ability of the RF anti-theft system is far less than that of the AM anti-theft system. The RF anti-theft system is extremely vulnerable to metal shielding (so the detection rate of the RF anti-theft system is not as good as that of the AM anti-theft system.
From the perspective of false alarm rate, the false alarm rate of the AM anti-theft system is extremely low, while the false alarm rate of the RF anti-theft system is slightly higher.
If your supermarket has a large area and a large number of customers, it is better to install a sound and magnetic anti-theft system, because large supermarkets have more varieties of goods to be anti-theft, and supermarket anti-theft with a stronger detection rate is required. System to guard against theft.
Another point is the impact of the supermarket itself and the surrounding environment. Because the RF anti-theft system is very susceptible to metal interference, if you want to install the RF anti-theft system, there should be no large electronic equipment around the installation point of the anti-theft door in the supermarket.
If you have also installed a RF anti-theft system in the shops around your supermarket, you'd better not install a RF anti-theft system, because the use of the two together will greatly affect the detection performance. Finally, consider installing a RF anti-theft system or an acoustic-magnetic anti-theft system.
