7 best headphones for guitar: from budget to professional
Some are designed to cancel out the outside noise, they work with your AMP, and then there are those ultra-precise sounding headphones that help you hear every single note and catch your mistakes when practicing.
Whether you’re into studio practice, at-home practice, gigs, mixing, or recording, I’ve got you covered with some of the best headphones for guitar with cheap, mid-price, and premium options.
