How Can I Get Closer to God?
John chapter 3:1-16 says that when we become a Christian we are “born again” as newborn babies into His family. As His new child, and just as when a human is born, we as Christian babies must grow in our relationship with Him.
We do not lose our relationship as His child, but we must maintain our fellowship with God by confessing any and all sins whenever we fail, as often as necessary. We must also allow the Holy Spirit to give us victory over sins we tend to repeat; any sin.
There are many examples of God speaking to people in the Bible, but there are also lots of warnings about following false prophets who claim God spoke to them when God says definitely that He did not. So how are we to know?
