Many people wonder as they turn from the grave of their loved ones, “Will we know our loved ones in heaven”?
The Lord understands your grief. He carried our sorrows… For He wept at the grave of His dear friend Lazarus even though He knew He would raise him up within a few moments.
It continues on forever. “For in the resurrection they neither marry, nor are given in marriage, but are as the angels of God in heaven.” ~ Matthew 22:30
